-- Purpose :
--           Synopsys synthesis timing constraint script for the 
--           SSP block             
--
--           Located in the synopsys/scripts directory.   
--
--           This file specifies the point-to-point exceptions 
--           set for the SSP block synthesis. 
--
-- --=================================================================*/

/* Set false path from SSPCLK to  PCLK */
set_false_path -from {SSPCLK} -to {PCLK}

/* Set false path from PCLK to  SSPCLK */
set_false_path -from {PCLK} -to {SSPCLK}

/* The SSPINTR and SSPRTINTR interrupts outputs are fed by signals generated in */
/* both PCLK and SSPCLK domains. Hence, these outputs are effectively           */
/* asynchronous and will need to be synchronised externally before feeding the   */
/* Interrupt Controller. Any constraint on these asynchronous pins can never     */
/* be accurate; hence false paths are set on these outputs.                      */

/* set_false_path -to SSPINTR */
/* set_false_path -to SSPRTINTR */

/********************* End of Ssp_exceptions.scr *******************/
